{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "4031861a65b52f9a249f1cda091cbaa181ed58008ae1dcf8236690bcc0cf9def", "ja": "{$P$}さん！！\n聞いてください！！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！！\n请听我说！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b89da927c6c800df8079c4e2834e86c9f8da6690cf3273af51a5f03df60781d1", "ja": "うわビックリした！\n美奈子？　そんなに勢い込んで、どうした？", "zh": "哇，吓了我一跳！\n美奈子？你这么风风火火的，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "57be8f1328714b62142e56f73b9aff0cfbcafb70b95fa0157787e08eb5c67333", "ja": "あの子、もらい手が見つかったんです！", "zh": "那孩子找到愿意收养她的人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7ed0c7ce04c1df08b7fa8c583e349786c00565f3a0a9e62ba99ca0e5a105a774", "ja": "え！　あの子猫か？", "zh": "欸！是那只小猫吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "08491c3b39621a67b7cde494ed40c05e1b2b70798b8b2b28500ba34643da527e", "ja": "はい！　うちの店のお客さんが貼り紙を見て……、\nできれば明日にも受け取りたいって。", "zh": "是的！我们店的客人看到告示后……说如果可以的话，想明天就来领走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1007_p", "source_sha256": "108472a804c7ff2eb32fc562a2a18eae1dfc4a26e0800de35fef0794024523e1", "ja": "そうか……よかったじゃないか！", "zh": "这样啊……那不是挺好的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "d5ae548367da0c2af386abee3b1a20ab8c4c3526474e4acc093346498285ff33", "ja": "はい！　本当に、{$P$}さんには\nご迷惑おかけしました。ごめんなさい！", "zh": "是的！真的给{$P$}先生添了不少麻烦。对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c04ee1b52d0ffd88ca5af9d5401b9b9c0201393baa72a40b2b3f906e2c384734", "ja": "とんでもない。とにかくよかったよ。\n子猫もすっかり元気になったし。", "zh": "没那回事。总之，真是太好了。\n小猫也已经完全恢复精神了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7985b65029e45d3105cf17b6033cee6f6bbeccfe7f1c8f36414384f3bb3c4dcb", "ja": "それも含めて、美奈子が頑張ったおかげだ。", "zh": "包括这些在内，都是多亏了美奈子的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "f2ef11dc86a8f923dc63c4e0e8bef1e49f9ad42d4367eef34a1a188fd1bee9d2", "ja": "……いいえ。私のことも含めて、\n{$P$}さんとみんなのおかげです♪", "zh": "……不。包括我在内，都是多亏了{$P$}先生和大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "d19c4f1aaab436561d6036f28f44f6daa3e33c6e83e73e0875079bcfd2dfeb85", "ja": "……あっ、いけない、もうこんな時間だ。", "zh": "……啊，不好，已经这么晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1013_p", "source_sha256": "68d67f8f7d9895711574caf53a01b5ada4438cb4ad1bcd9e56544f370ee2f4fc", "ja": "？　何か用事でもあるのか？", "zh": "？ 有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "245a08eb42f8c50687235c46b418a56925fe7570a735a3ffaafe3b4620c099df", "ja": "あの子を送り出すのに、新しいお布団を作ってあげよう\nって亜美ちゃんたちと話してたんです。", "zh": "为了送那孩子出门，我们想给她做套新被褥，\n刚才正和亚美她们商量这事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "8bf1db6c97c670f4a9efcb9ecd4d22f128fbec38ff2c7196f3e22b05622d612d", "ja": "それで、これからみんなと布地を買いに行くんです♪\nえへへ、それじゃ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "所以，我正要和大家一起去买布料♪\n嘿嘿，那我出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1016_p", "source_sha256": "633639905d070f418ee74f4965f9fa5ce4a211437dc25f0051edae9a6b4664d5", "ja": "ああ、気をつけてな！\n……って、もう行っちゃったか。", "zh": "啊，路上小心啊！\n……等等，已经走掉了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_146_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f6140d5217259bc7533f9e7a2a71e3dcb97300d182cb88359a3a2272c2338910", "ja": "（いつも届くとは限らない。信じてもらえないかも\nしれない。でも美奈子はきっと、輝き続けるだろう）", "zh": "（并不总能传达到。也许不会被相信。但美奈子一定会继续闪耀下去吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
